  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jordan Growth Multi-Donor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Jordan Inclusive Growth and Economic Opportunities Multi-Donor Trust Fund (Growth MDTF), implemented by the World Bank in partnership with the Government of Jordan, supports structural economic reform to advance inclusive growth, job creation, and fiscal sustainability. 

The program provides technical assistance and institutional strengthening across public financial management, regulatory reform, competition policy, investment climate, capital market development, labor market reform, and social protection systems. It supports climate mitigation and adaptation through green finance, emissions monitoring (MRV systems), low-carbon and climate-resilient strategy development, and energy sector reforms.

The MDTF also promotes gender equality and social inclusion through gender-responsive reform analysis, labor market diagnostics, and improved data systems. Cross-cutting support includes strengthening government reform management, transparency, digitalization (including e-procurement), and evidence-based policymaking aligned with Jordan&#x2019;s Economic Modernization Vision.</narrative>
  </description>
